  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-02">Implement ACS Event Grid ingress: a validated webhook → a Service Bus job. Acceptance is completed jointly with 031 (exactly-one idempotent persist); this task delivers the validated ingress + enqueue leg.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-046">ACS is transport; Event Grid is the inbound transport for ACS chat events per ADR-046 (task 007). The endpoint receives transport events only — it does not touch the Dataverse record.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-004 / ADR-036">Enqueue onto the EXISTING `Services/Jobs/` contract (`JobSubmissionService` / job envelope); reuse the Service Bus job pipeline. Do NOT create a second queue or job mechanism (§11 / root §10 — extend, don't fork).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008 / ADR-019">Endpoint hygiene: thin handler, ProblemDetails on error; the ingress must return the Event Grid validation response synchronously on the handshake and 200 fast on real events. Follow existing webhook-validation precedent (Graph subscription validation) for structure.</constraint>
    <constraint source="security">Only a VALIDATED webhook enqueues. The Event Grid subscription-validation handshake activates the subscription; verify deliveries originate from the subscribed ACS system topic before enqueue. An unvalidated/spoofed payload MUST NOT reach the job queue. (Security-relevant — call out in code-review.)</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Thin ingress only — MUST NOT normalize the ACS event, persist `sprk_communication`, run enrichment, dedupe, or DLQ inline (all 031). MUST NOT introduce a client-side ACS SDK. Server-side only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Any Azure/ACS/Event Grid client uses the central `TokenCredential`; MUST NOT `new` a credential / `ConfidentialClientApplication`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032">If the ingress endpoint is feature-gated, register any gated service as ADR-032 Null-Object with UNCONDITIONAL endpoint registration (endpoints that map unconditionally must have unconditional service registration).</constraint>
    <constraint source="root §10">bff-extensions Placement Justification in the PR (Event Grid ingress lives in BFF — sole policy point); publish-size delta vs ~45.30 MB baseline; no new HIGH CVE. Run `/conflict-check` before PR (shared `Services/Communication/` hot-path).</constraint>
  </constraints>

