    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Job enqueue via the shared contract" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/JobSubmissionService.cs">
        Build a job envelope + submit onto Service Bus using the existing contract; a new job type is a new handler + envelope kind, not a new queue. The ingress enqueues; 031's handler consumes.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Webhook validation handshake" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/">
        The Graph subscription webhook already answers a validation handshake + verifies client state. Mirror the shape for Event Grid: detect `SubscriptionValidationEvent`, echo `validationCode`; verify topic origin on real events before enqueue.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
